  "earlier_episode_silent_omissions_reason": "Episodes 1-5 have no claims at all, so every entry in their evidence register is an uncited omission and silent-omission fires on each. That is the rule working as designed on a record that has not yet drawn conclusions; out/findings_matrix.json reports the per-episode count with this reason."
